@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title UML sequence — voice / durable async processing
actor Owner
participant "Channel adapter" as Channel
participant "AcceptMessage" as Accept
participant "Media Store" as Media
database "Inbox / Jobs / Outbox" as DB
participant "Worker" as Worker
participant "Local inference" as AI
participant "Journal / State / Insights" as Domain
Owner -> Channel : Voice message
Channel -> Accept : Source ID + media
Accept -> Media : Durable file
Media --> Accept : Media reference
Accept -> DB : Transaction: inbox + job + receipt
DB --> Accept : Commit
Accept --> Channel : Durable receipt
Channel --> Owner : Accepted / processing
Worker -> DB : Claim lease
DB --> Worker : Job + input versions
Worker -> AI : Speech / extraction request
AI --> Worker : Structured candidates + evidence
Worker -> Domain : Validate candidates + current revisions
alt auto-confirm enabled
 Domain -> DB : Transaction: accepted records + next outbox + job complete
else confirmation required
 Domain -> DB : Transaction: pending extraction + job complete
end
Worker --> Channel : Result / confirmation prompt
Channel --> Owner : Response + processing status
note over Worker, DB
Inference runs outside DB transaction.
Stale lease / input revision cannot commit.
end note
@enduml
